<title>USA: Highwoods/Forsyth sets $210 mln two-part debt deal.</title>
<headline>Highwoods/Forsyth sets $210 mln two-part debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Highwoods/Forsyth LP was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER HIGHWOODS/FORSYTH LP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2003</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.735  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.79 PCT    PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 80 BP	MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 20</p>
<p>						   BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>BORROWER HIGHWOODS/FORSYTH LP</p>
<p>AMT $110 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.73   FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.038 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 95 BP	MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 25</p>
<p>						     BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
